{
  "name": "closure",
  "class": "закрытие истории",
  "description": "Закрытие: новый event_id с днём < closed_until отвергается closed_past; закрытие необратимо — повтор с новым event_id отклоняется так же. Монотонность и границы /admin/time: now не убывает, closed_until <= now и <= observed_until (§5).",
  "question": "Событие e-351 отклонено closed_past. Можно ли «протолкнуть» его, повторив с новым event_id или изменив payload? Что произойдёт с состоянием клиента A?",
  "input": {
    "observed_from": "2011-01-01",
    "observed_until": "2011-04-01",
    "reference_until": "2011-03-01"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "time",
      "now": "2011-02-01",
      "closed_until": "2011-01-10"
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-350",
        "invoice_id": "I950",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-15T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "10.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-351",
        "invoice_id": "I951",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-08T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "20.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "closed_past_rejected",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "received_total",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_rejection",
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "event",
      "reason": [
        "closed_past"
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Закрытие необратимо: новый event_id с тем же днём отклоняется так же."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-352",
        "invoice_id": "I951",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-09T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "20.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "closed_past_rejected",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Монотонность и границы времени: нарушение -> 400 invalid_request, время не меняется."
    },
    {
      "op": "time_reject",
      "now": "2011-01-30",
      "closed_until": "2011-01-10"
    },
    {
      "op": "time_reject",
      "now": "2011-02-01",
      "closed_until": "2011-02-05"
    },
    {
      "op": "time_reject",
      "now": "2011-04-02",
      "closed_until": "2011-04-02"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "now",
      "value": "2011-02-01"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "closed_until",
      "value": "2011-01-10"
    },
    {
      "op": "activate",
      "model_name": "hw4-logistic",
      "model_version": "1",
      "activation_id": "scen-closure-1"
    },
    {
      "op": "time",
      "now": "2011-03-01",
      "closed_until": "2011-02-01"
    },
    {
      "op": "request",
      "payload": {
        "request_id": "r-clo-1",
        "client_id": "A",
        "as_of": "2011-03-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_prediction",
      "request_id": "r-clo-1",
      "status": "ok",
      "features": {
